 {
  "text": "I went to Florida with my son.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a5_i_went_to_florida_with_my_son.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "We had a great time.",
  "voice": "sarah_us",
  "file": "a5_we_had_a_great_time.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Did you go anywhere?",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a5_did_you_go_anywhere.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "I didn't work on Friday.",
  "voice": "sarah_us",
  "file": "a5_i_didn_t_work_on_friday.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Hi, Fernanda! Before we start, how was your long weekend?",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a5_hi_fernanda_before_we_start_how_was_your_long_we.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Hi, Daniel! It was great, thanks. I took a day off on Friday, so I had four days.",
  "voice": "sarah_us",
  "file": "a5_hi_daniel_it_was_great_thanks_i_took_a_day_off_o.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Nice! Did you go anywhere?",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a5_nice_did_you_go_anywhere.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Yes, I did. I went on a trip to Florida with my son. We had a great time.",
  "voice": "sarah_us",
  "file": "a5_yes_i_did_i_went_on_a_trip_to_florida_with_my_so.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Florida! How was the flight?",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a5_florida_how_was_the_flight.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "It was long, but my son slept. We got back on Tuesday, and I am still a little tired.",
  "voice": "sarah_us",
  "file": "a5_it_was_long_but_my_son_slept_we_got_back_on_tues.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "I know that feeling. I flew to London last month, and I had jet lag for a week.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a5_i_know_that_feeling_i_flew_to_london_last_month.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Oh no! Did you go for work?",
  "voice": "sarah_us",
  "file": "a5_oh_no_did_you_go_for_work.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Yes, I did. I visited a customer there. OK, shall we start the meeting?",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a5_yes_i_did_i_visited_a_customer_there_ok_shall_we.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "It was great, thanks. And you?",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a5_it_was_great_thanks_and_you.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "I took a day off on Friday.",
  "voice": "sarah_us",
  "file": "a5_i_took_a_day_off_on_friday.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Did you do anything special this weekend?",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a5_did_you_do_anything_special_this_weekend.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "We got back on Tuesday.",
  "voice": "sarah_us",
  "file": "a5_we_got_back_on_tuesday.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Oh, good morning! Yes, I had a very nice weekend, thank you. On Saturday, my husband and I went to the mountains. We took the train at seven in the morning, and we walked for five hours. It was cold, but the view was beautiful. We came back very tired. On Sunday, we didn't go out. We stayed at home, we cooked, and we watched a film. It was a quiet day, and I needed it. And you, Fernanda? How was your weekend?",
  "voice": "german_f",
  "file": "a5_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Hello, everyone. Yes, I am back. In China, the first week of October is a holiday. We call it Golden Week. I went to my hometown to see my parents. I took the fast train. It was about six hours, and the train was very full, because everybody travels in this week. My mother cooked every day, and I ate too much. I also saw some old friends from school. I got back on Sunday night. I brought some tea for the team, so when you visit the plant, you can try it.",
  "voice": "chinese_m",
  "file": "a5_listening2.mp3"
 },
